---
title: Subscription
description: Your trial, your plan, and what happens when a payment fails.
---

Each organization has its own subscription. Only admins see the **Subscription** menu and can change the plan.

{% aside %}This page covers the Cloud plan. For your own instance or on-premises, choose **Request my instance** or **Get in touch** on the plans page: we set it all up with you.{% /aside %}

## Trial

A new organization may start with a free trial. While it runs, a banner tells you when it ends, for example "The trial ends in 14 days", with a link to **Pick a plan**.

A few days before the end, whoever created the organization also gets a reminder by email.

When the trial ends without a plan, the organization is locked: see [Locked organization](#locked-organization).

## Pick a plan

{% steps %}

1. Go to **Subscription** and choose **Pick a plan**, or follow the link in the trial banner.

2. Pick the billing, for example monthly or yearly, and choose **Subscribe** on the plan that suits you.

3. Pay on the payment page. You then come back to nullish, which activates your subscription as soon as the payment is confirmed. It usually takes a few seconds.

{% /steps %}

## Manage the subscription

**Subscription** shows your plan, its status and when the current period ends.

Choose **Manage the subscription** to change the payment method, download your invoices or cancel. A cancelled subscription keeps running until the end of the period already paid.

## Payment failed

If a payment fails, a banner tells you the date the organization will be locked. Update the payment method under **Manage the subscription** before then and everything goes on as usual.

## Locked organization

An organization whose subscription is no longer active is locked: its data can't be accessed until it has a plan again.

After a trial, admins can choose **See the plans** to subscribe. Admins can also delete the organization.
